      problems than I expect; get back to me.)  If the files exist:

   o  Copy your 'nhdat' file to the /dat subdirectory.  Enter this
      command:

dlb_main tv

      (dlb_main.exe might be called dlb.exe on *nix systems.)
      The data librarian will list all the files contained in the
      big 'nhdat' file, then give a summary looking somewhat like:

Revision:1  File count:129  String size:1667 

      How many files are there?  (If the file count is about 170,
